  - id: sanctification_and_brotherly_love
    displayName: Sanctification and Brotherly Love
    flavorText: Paul instructs the church to possess their bodies in sanctification
      and honour, and to keep growing in the brotherly love they are already taught
      of God to practice.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Instructs the church on practical holy living now that they have received
      the gospel \u2014 sexual purity, continuing in brotherly love, and living quietly
      and working with one's own hands so as to walk honestly before outsiders."
