  - id: the_dead_in_christ
    displayName: The Dead in Christ
    flavorText: Paul comforts the grieving Thessalonians with the promise that the
      dead in Christ shall rise first and be reunited with the living at the Lord's
      coming.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Addresses grief over believers who had already died before the Lord's
      return, teaching that those who sleep in Jesus will be raised and reunited
      with living believers at Christ's coming, meant explicitly as comfort rather
      than mere doctrine.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_1thessalonians
