  - id: the_day_of_the_lord
    displayName: The Day of the Lord
    flavorText: Paul warns that the day of the Lord will come like a thief in the
      night, calling the children of light to stay watchful and sober.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Teaches that the day of the Lord's coming will arrive suddenly and unexpectedly,
      so believers, as children of light, should live watchful and sober lives rather
      than being taken unaware.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_1thessalonians
