    displayName: Quench Not the Spirit
    flavorText: "Paul closes with rapid instructions for orderly, Spirit-led congregational
      life \u2014 rejoice evermore, pray without ceasing, and quench not the Spirit."
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "A rapid series of closing instructions for orderly, Spirit-led congregational
      life \u2014 honoring those who labour and lead, admonishing the unruly while
      comforting the fainthearted, pursuing joy and unceasing prayer, and not suppressing
      the Spirit's work while testing everything against what is good."
